"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Auntie_Ethel.27s_Special_Brew\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Auntie_Ethel's_Special_Brew\"> Condition: Auntie Ethel's Special Brew </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel%27s_Special_Brew_(Condition)\" title=\"Auntie Ethel's Special Brew (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel's Special Brew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel%27s_Special_Brew_(Condition)\" title=\"Aun